# CSS & Tailwind Standards

Tailwind is build-time via `tailwind.config.ts` + PostCSS. **No CDN, no inline config.**

## Theme Tokens (use instead of hex)

| Token | Hex | Usage |
|-------|-----|-------|
| `bg-sidebar` | `#F9F9FB` | Page backgrounds, panels |
| `text-primary` | `#111827` | Primary text |
| `text-secondary` | `#6B7280` | Secondary text |
| `bg-accent` / `text-accent` | `#6366F1` | Accent/indigo |
| `bg-bubble-note` | `#FEF3C7` | Note mode backgrounds |
| `bg-stage-default` | `#64748b` | Stage color fallback |

**Never** write `bg-[#F9F9FB]`, `text-[#111827]`, etc. Use the token.

## Reusable Classes (defined in `index.css` `@layer components`)

| Class | For |
|-------|-----|
| `form-input` | Text/number inputs |
| `form-input-mono` | Monospace inputs |
| `form-textarea` | Textareas (rounded-xl) |
| `form-textarea-mono` | Monospace textareas |
| `form-select` | Select dropdowns |
| `form-checkbox` | Checkbox styling |
| `form-label` | Uppercase field labels |
| `btn-primary` | Dark (gray-900) button |
| `btn-accent` | Indigo button |
| `btn-ghost` | Text/cancel button |
| `btn-danger` | Red button |
| `btn-sm` | Smaller size modifier |
| `card` | White card + border + shadow |
| `page-shell` | Centered page with sidebar bg |

Override with additional classes: `className="form-input pl-10"`, `className="form-textarea min-h-[200px]"`

## Rules

- **Use existing classes** — don't reinvent input/label/button styles per component.
- **Use `FormCheckbox` component** for all checkboxes — never write raw `<input type="checkbox">` with ad-hoc styling.
- **No `font-sans` on components** — it's on `<body>`.
- **New reusable patterns** go in `index.css` `@layer components`, not as local constants.
- **Dynamic colors** in `style={{}}` are fine (e.g. stage colors from API).
